{"lyrics":"[Intro: Kodak Black]\n[00:00.70]I'm stompin'\n[00:05.42]Let's start a moshpit\n[00:09.88]Fuck a protest, let's start a moshpit\n[00:14.98]Yeah\n[Chorus: Kodak Black & Juice WRLD]\n[00:15.18]Red bottom kicks, I feel like stompin' in here (\n[00:17.06]Ya dig\n[00:17.20])\n[00:17.26]No oatmeal and grits, I'm eatin' codfish in here (Uh-huh)\n[00:19.10]New space coupe, feel like a martian in here (Yeah)\n[00:20.84]Fuck a protest, let's start a moshpit (Fuck a protest)\n[00:22.22]Red bottom kicks, I feel like stompin' in here (\n[00:23.54]Ya dig\n[00:23.76])\n[00:23.84]No oatmeal and grits, I'm eatin' cod fish in here (Eatin' cod fish in here)\n[00:27.10]New space coupe, feel like a martian in here (Skrrt)\n[00:28.98]Fuck a protest, let's start a moshpit (Start a moshpit)\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[00:37.26]Out of space, hot like a martian in here\n[00:39.86]Doing donuts in the lot, ain't no parkin' in here (Yeah)\n[00:43.42]We about that action, ain't no talkin' in here\n[00:45.90]Shorty twerkin' on the walls, Peter Parker in here (Ayy)\n[00:49.34]Haters in the rear-view\n[00:51.04]X on my phone, we too loud, I can't hear you\n[00:53.70]His blood turn his coat red, I will Paul Revere you\n[00:57.02]I'ma ball 'til I fall, I will Cavalier you\n[00:59.90]Space Jam jumpin', they askin' who let the monsters in here\n[01:03.44]I'm with killers I'm with straight Jeffrey Dahmers in here\n[01:06.40]I hang with animals, lil' brodie brought the llama in here\n[01:09.46]Money old, old enough to fuck your mama in here, oh yeah\n[Chorus: Kodak Black & Juice WRLD]\n[01:13.68]Red bottom kicks, I feel like stompin' in here (\n[01:15.92]Ya dig\n[01:16.50])\n[01:16.56]No oatmeal and grits, I'm eatin' codfish in here (Uh-huh)\n[01:19.90]New space coupe, feel like a martian in here (Yeah)\n[01:21.60]Fuck a protest, let's start a moshpit (Fuck a protest)\n[01:23.62]Red bottom kicks, I feel like stompin' in here (\n[01:25.94]Ya dig\n[01:26.06])\n[01:26.12]No oatmeal and grits, I'm eatin' cod fish in here (Eating cod fish in here)\n[01:28.02]New space coupe, feel like a martian in here (Skrrt)\n[01:34.90]Fuck a protest, let's start a moshpit (Start a moshpit)\n[Verse 2: Kodak Black]\n[01:37.98]Fuck a protest, let's start a fight in here\n[01:40.76]I just stepped up in the party, all my snipers here\n[01:43.84]I be rocking Tom Ford, poppin' Molly, though\n[01:46.76]Now I'm eatin' calamari, no more sloppy joe\n[01:49.76]Choke sandwich in my mansion, tryna save for dinner\n[01:52.94]I'ma start a moshpit in the Staples Center\n[01:55.90]All you niggas bitter, it's alright, though\n[01:58.90]Codeine in my liver, I'm sippin' hydro\n[02:01.72]I'm blowin' nitro, smokin' jetpack\n[02:05.00]Hatin' on a street nigga, can't respect that\n[02:07.96]I wanna jump out in a crowd, but I be scared to do it\n[02:10.62]'Cause if they pull on me the wrong way, I'ma go to shootin'\n[Chorus: Kodak Black]\n[02:14.04]Yeah, red bottom kicks, I feel like stompin' in here\n[02:22.74]No oatmeal and grits, I'm eatin' codfish in here\n[02:43.46]New space coupe, feel like a martian in here (Yeah)\n[02:53.52]Fuck a protest, let's start a moshpit\n[02:58.76]Red bottom kicks, I feel like stompin' in here\n[03:08.52]No oatmeal and grits, I'm eatin' cod fish in here (Ayy)\n[03:33.56]New space coupe, feel like a martian in here\n[03:36.40]Fuck a protest, let's start a moshpit","words":[[0.7,4.66,"I'm"],[4.78,5.34,"stompin'"],[5.42,5.5,"Let's"],[5.62,5.92,"start"],[6.76,6.76,"a"],[8.34,9.62,"moshpit"],[9.88,12.64,"Fuck"],[13.0,13.0,"a"],[13.24,13.98,"protest,"],[14.12,14.24,"let's"],[14.28,14.48,"start"],[14.52,14.52,"a"],[14.6,14.94,"moshpit"],[14.98,15.14,"Yeah"],[15.18,15.72,"Red"],[15.82,16.02,"bottom"],[16.06,16.16,"kicks,"],[16.2,16.2,"I"],[16.28,16.42,"feel"],[16.46,16.52,"like"],[16.56,16.8,"stompin'"],[16.84,16.86,"in"],[16.9,16.96,"here"],[16.98,17.02,"("],[17.06,17.08,"Ya"],[17.12,17.18,"dig"],[17.2,17.22,")"],[17.26,17.28,"No"],[17.48,17.62,"oatmeal"],[17.66,17.7,"and"],[1